T1  - Pharmacy meets AI: Effect of a drug information activity on student perceptions of generative artificial intelligence
AU  - Munir, Faria
AU  - Ipema, Heather
AU  - Nohria, Rahul
AU  - Singh, Divita
JO  - Currents in Pharmacy Teaching and Learning
VL  - 17
IS  - 10
