TY  - JOUR
T1  - AI-assisted concept mapping enhances orthopaedic nursing students’ critical thinking: A quasi-experimental study
AU  - Sutthiviriwan, Satik
AU  - Pinyo, Nuntawat
AU  - Kuptanont, Khwanchit
AU  - Sukwatjanee, Arrisara
JO  - International Journal of Orthopaedic and Trauma Nursing
VL  - 62
